                            ],
                            Label: "fight_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Walk away",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "walk_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "You again — and not to talk acreage this time. Someone at the archive has been asking the wrong questions, and now here you are at my fence."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Fine. Off the record, then. No memo, no audit, no witnesses. Settle it and one of us stops appraising this town."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Liaison — off the record",
                    Label: "off_record_fight"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Good for the Company",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "A fine parcel. South-facing, well watered, poorly papered. Almost nobody holds clean title in this town - a detail, but details are my whole portfolio."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "Company liaison, resident. Head office has me verifying acreage this quarter. The region has such promising fundamentals - whoever owns the ground under a thing owns the thing. Enjoy the fields while they are scenery."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Liaison — appraising the field",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
